Gaussian: mu_hat = 1/4*x1 + 1/4*x2 + 1/4*x3 + 1/4*x4 ; equals the sample mean: True
          sigma_hat^2 = 3/16*x1^2 - 1/8*x1*x2 + 3/16*x2^2 - 1/8*x1*x3 - 1/8*x2*x3 + 3/16*x3^2 - 1/8*x1*x4 - 1/8*x2*x4 - 1/8*x3*x4 + 3/16*x4^2 ; equals the biased sample variance: True
Poisson: lambda_hat = 1/4*k1 + 1/4*k2 + 1/4*k3 + 1/4*k4 ; second derivative there: -16/(k1 + k2 + k3 + k4) < 0 for positive counts
